        165.9265594482422,
        476.1767883300781,
        204.8098602294922
      ],
      "text": "YES\nif the statement agrees with the claims of the writer\nNO\nif the statement contradicts the claims of the writer\nNOT GIVEN\nif it is impossible to say what the writer thinks about this\n"
